  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あ、さっき買ったレモンティー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、これはただのレモンティーじゃないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……ど、どういうこと……？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実は……飲んだ人をクイズ博士にしてしまう、\r\nおまじないをかけたレモンティーなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうなのっ？　えへへ\r\nおまじないなんて灯織みたい！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さて、モノは試しだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "念じるんだ……これを一口飲めば、\r\nめぐるはたちまちクイズ博士だと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010320,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "これを飲めばクイズ博士……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "一口、飲めば──……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010330"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010340,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……ごくん……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……では問題です\r\n夜空に座っているものはなあに？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010350,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "夜空に座ってるもの……あっ思い出せるかも！\r\nえっと……、ああっ……！　あとちょっと……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "八宮さーん\r\n後半戦が始まりますのでスタンバイお願いしまーす",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010360,
    "speaker": "めぐる＆プロデューサー",
    "text": "あーーーー！！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010360"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全部答えようと思わないで、\r\n自信がある問題で勝負をかけるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010370,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "！　そっか……そうだよね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010370"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010380,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたし、全部答えなくちゃって思ってたみたい\r\n得意な問題だけでもいいんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010380"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010390,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん……うんっ\r\nなんだかやれる気がしてきたよー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010390"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、少しは参考になったみたいで良かった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010400,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ん……アイドルって歌やダンスだけじゃないんだねー\r\nMCも、お芝居も、クイズも、料理も……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010400"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010410,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんでもできちゃうパーフェクトなアイドル、\r\n本当の『一流アイドル』への道はまだまだ遠いなー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010410"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるは、なんでもできるようになりたいのか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010420,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うーん、なれたらいいよね！\r\nできることがたくさんあったら楽しそうって思う！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010420"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そっか、じゃあ頑張らなくちゃな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010430,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ、なれるかどうかはわからないよー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010430"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わからないから楽しみになるんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010440,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そう？　……もし結果が出なくても……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010440"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうだろう、めぐるはどう思う？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010450,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それは……そのクイズは難しいなー",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010450"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010460,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "きっと未来のわたしが答えてくれると思う！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010460"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "逃げたな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010470,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "逃げてないよ\r\nこれも待ちの戦法だよー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300701/2003007010470"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そういうことにしておこう\r\nそろそろ時間だな、いけそうか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007010480,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっプロデューサー\r\n……ちょっと手を貸して！",
